# Styles

Tokens live in `packages/tokens/src/variables.css`. `packages/tokens/src/styles.css` pulls in the global CSS, and `@mnb/ui` imports that once. Do not add a second global stylesheet.

## Look

Brutalist mono, not the old mint/pink theme:

- Paper is `--mnb-color-offwhite` / `--mnb-color-paper`. Ink is `--mnb-color-ink` / `--mnb-color-black`
- Borders are thick and black (`--mnb-border-width-thick`, `--mnb-color-black`)
- Shadows are hard offsets (`--mnb-shadow-sm` is `2px 2px 0 black`), not soft blurs
- `--mnb-color-secondary` (blue) is for focus and rare emphasis only
- Type uses `--mnb-font-display` for UI labels and `--mnb-font-primary` for body

## Rules

- Prefer an existing token over a new raw value. Spacing is the `--space-*` scale
- A new color, size, or shadow is added to `variables.css` and then referenced. Do not paste hex into a component
- Component CSS is scoped and nested with the project's PostCSS setup. Shared components use an `mnb-` root class and short part names, not BEM
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` for anything that animates (see `packages/tokens/src/animations.css`)
- Give images and media a size or `aspect-ratio` so the page does not jump
